<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 427 &amp; 336 ALL OUT V ENGLAND 313.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 427 &amp; 336 ALL OUT V ENGLAND 313.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out for 336 in their second innings, leaving England to score 451 to win, on the fourth day of the fifth Ashes test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 427 and 336, England 313.</p>
</text>
